<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 24.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 24.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 24     June 23   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  271.900     272.520     247.020   10.07 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.140     309.250     306.830    0.75 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.715     157.880     158.970   -0.79 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.730	46.786	47.182   -0.96 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  454.200     451.720     419.180    8.35 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.165     140.345     141.685   -1.07 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.140	16.136	16.185   -0.28 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  237.170     236.190     212.430   11.65 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.867	 1.871	 1.888   -1.11 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.563	 1.567	 1.581   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.325     189.480     183.135    3.38 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
